<http://data.silknow.org/object/928dce05-f131-369c-a065-8456bd7dbf07>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man’s sword hanger and front strap of leather. The hanger is covered with black silk taffeta and lined with black silk velvet. No fabric remains on the front strap, only the leather with a metal hook at the end. The hanger is couched with black silk thread in a geometric pattern. It has 5 scabbard straps, each held with a metal buckle."@en , "Hanger and front strap of a man's sword belt, 1600-1624, English; leather, black silk embroidered"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/f036ced1-0183-3d55-a481-bf8e1514cbf1> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e6f89c87-928f-3c42-a573-c3e8a6d580cf> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f81943e3-718d-3c8e-a101-2b846af75c00> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Man’s sword hanger and front strap of leather. The hanger is covered with black silk taffeta and lined with black silk velvet. No fabric remains on the front strap, only the leather with a metal hook at the end. The hanger is couched with black silk thread in a geometric pattern. It has 5 scabbard straps, each held with a metal buckle."@en , "Hanger and front strap of a man's sword belt, 1600-1624, English; leather, black silk embroidered"@en ;
